<title>USA: Hillsborough, N.J., school bonds won by Prudential.</title>
<headline>Hillsborough, N.J., school bonds won by Prudential.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities Inc said Thursday it won $39 million Board of Education of the Township of Hillsborough, N.J., bonds at a net interest cost of 5.36 percent.</p>
</text>
